<title>GERMANY: Thyssen sees steel merger profit in 97.</title>
<headline>Thyssen sees steel merger profit in 97.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German industrial group Thyssen AG said on Thursday it expected its newly founded steel venture with Fried. Krupp AG to turn a profit this year.</p>
<p>&quot;The company will be profitable right from the start,&quot; Thyssen chief Dieter Vogel said at a news conference. When asked if that meant 1997, he replied, &quot;Yes.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 260 97 150</p>
